  "@@_PROFILING_PERSONAS": "=== Profiling persona names + descriptions (5 personas) ===",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaConsciousOutdoorsName": "Conscious Outdoors",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaConsciousOutdoorsDescription": "You're at your best with salt on your skin or dirt on your shoes. Hikes, surf mornings, group trips. Your social life and your values go hand in hand. If it's outside and it matters, you're already there.",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaLocalAtHeartName": "Local at Heart",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaLocalAtHeartDescription": "You love the city like a local: corner bars that haven't changed in decades, live music in small rooms, a meal that costs nothing and tastes like everything. No trend-chasing; just authentic city living.",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaCuriousCosmopolitanName": "Curious Cosmopolitan",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaCuriousCosmopolitanDescription": "You find things before they have a name. A cafe that just opened, a courtyard show no one's posted about yet, a flea market stall with exactly what you didn't know you needed. You're not chasing trends. You're where they start.",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaGoldenAgeName": "Golden Age",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaGoldenAgeDescription": "You've made space for the things that last. A long afternoon in a bookstore, a concert you've been anticipating, a restaurant where the waiter knows your name. You prefer things with a bit of history and a lot of care.",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaQualitySeekerName": "Quality Seeker",
  "personaOnboardingPersonaQualitySeekerDescription": "You'd rather have one perfect evening than five forgettable ones. A table that took weeks to book, a hotel with a story, a wine list someone actually thought about. You know the difference. And it matters to you.",

